{"_meta":{"openai/outputTemplate":"ui://predictionscan/widget-v2.html","openai/toolInvocation/invoked":"Loaded the trader profile","openai/toolInvocation/invoking":"Looking up the trader\u2026","openai/widgetAccessible":true,"securitySchemes":[{"type":"noauth"}],"ui":{"resourceUri":"ui://predictionscan/widget-v2.html"},"ui/resourceUri":"ui://predictionscan/widget-v2.html"},"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":true,"readOnlyHint":true,"title":"Get trader profile"},"description":"Use this when the user asks about one Polymarket trader or wallet \u2014 for example \"how is this wallet doing on Polymarket\" with a pasted 0x address, \"show me @exampletrader's Polymarket stats\", \"who is this trader\" with a polymarket.com profile link, or \"what has this trader been trading lately\". Accepts a full 0x wallet address, a polymarket.com profile URL, an @username or a username. Returns the public display name, all-time realized profit and dollar volume, current portfolio value, number of open positions, number of markets traded, up to five largest open positions and up to eight most recent trades of $1 or more. A username is matched exactly when possible; otherwise the closest public profile is used and the text says so. Read-only public on-chain data: it does not say who controls a wallet, and past results do not predict future results.","execution":{"taskSupport":"forbidden"},"inputSchema":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"trader":{"description":"The trader: a full 0x wallet address (42 characters), a polymarket.com profile URL, an @username, or a username, e.g. '@exampletrader'","maxLength":300,"minLength":1,"type":"string"}},"required":["trader"],"type":"object"},"name":"get_trader_profile","outputSchema":{"$schema":"http://json-schema.org/draft-07/schema#","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"kind":{"const":"trader","type":"string"},"name":{"type":["string","n